  DTS:Description="Rebuilds Aggregate.Monthly Sales Summary for the closing period and, optionally, a number of prior periods. Fiscal periods differ by region - NA runs to a 4-4-5 calendar, EU to the calendar month and APAC to an April-March year - so the period label comes from the date dimension rather than being derived here."
